  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A toggle for the relevant UI tabs (World, Social, Avatar) to remove thumbnails entirely, only displaying text, status, and favourite icons. \n\nI believe this would mitigate the large memory consumption caused by the constant loading of thumbnails associated with opening the menu, often causing massive frame drops or game stutters.\n\nThis would be an ideal stop-gap until the UI rework can be completed.",
